			"This is the library, Marshal.  Books, journals, wanted posters, newspapers, maps — anything a player can read, carry, or discover goes here.  Each document is an item that lives in a character's inventory and can be handed out, looted, or found.",
			"Pick a Category and the reader handles the rest.  Sourcebooks and web pages embed URLs in an iframe.  Journals, ledgers, letters, and other documents have dedicated side editors beside Text Content.  Maps and wanted posters have layout editors beside Image Path.  Newspapers open the full-layout editor beside Text Content.",
			"And yes, you can put boons on documents.  An ancient tome that requires a Cognition roll to decipher, a cursed journal that deals wind damage when read, a wanted poster with a bounty check — all through the on_use trigger, same as any other item.  The reader opens when the player 'uses' the document, and boons fire at the same time."
